# Cloudflare Pages — response headers for the Axal VC frontend.
#
# This replaces the dead `cloudflare.toml` at the repo root, which was written
# in Netlify's TOML dialect ([[headers]], [context.production]) that Cloudflare
# Pages has never read, and which nothing in this repository referenced. See
# documentation/architecture/CLOUDFLARE-PAGES-MIGRATION.md for that finding.
#
# Values are taken from the Worker's own live middleware
# (cloudflare-worker/src/middleware/securityHeaders.ts), NOT from the dead
# file, whose HSTS had already drifted to half the Worker's max-age.
#
# Referrer-Policy is deliberately the laxer value here. The Worker's
# authenticated API surface uses `no-referrer` (NICE-SEC-01) because its URLs
# carry ids and query params; these static pages carry neither and benefit
# from cross-origin referral attribution. The split is intentional — see
# GOTCHAS, "Backend / Worker". Do not unify them.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), bluetooth=(), accelerometer=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), midi=(), serial=(), hid=(), interest-cohort=()

# NO Content-Security-Policy here, and that is a decision rather than an
# omission. The Worker's CSP is nonce-based and generated per request, which a
# static header file cannot reproduce. index.html carries inline bootstrap
# script (the boot watchdog), so a naive `script-src 'self'` would break the
# app on load, and a wrong CSP on the frontend is a white screen for every
# visitor. The frontend has no enforced CSP today either — the file that
# claimed to set one was never read — so shipping without one is not a
# regression. Adding a correct static CSP needs the inline scripts enumerated
# and hashed against a real deployed preview; tracked in the migration doc.

# Hashed filenames make these safe to cache forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
